  "body": "This allows using a CSSImageValue inside the #drawImage or #createPattern methods.\nSee: https://drafts.css-houdini.org/css-typed-om/#imagevalue-objects\n\nAs an example:\n\n``` js\nconst val = elem.styleMap.get('--image-prop');\nctx.drawImage(val, 0, 0, 100, 100);\n```\n\nThis allows images to be passed into a CSS Paint API paint callback, for\nexample:\n\n``` js\nregisterPaint(class {\n  static inputProperties = ['--image']; // Registered custom <image> css property\n\n  paint(ctx, size, styleMap) {\n    ctx.drawImage(\n      styleMap.get('--image'), 0, 0, size.width, size.height);\n  }\n});\n```\n\ncc/\n@junov @domenic for initial review. :)\n\nThere are a bunch of other CSSOM types that we'll want to allow (filter, font, etc) but this is the easiest*.\n\n*for some definition of easiest.\n",
